# sol-headroom-own-notes, arm 2 (register sol-headroom-own-notes, §378.C): attempt 2, seeded with the
# SAME levels' notes in the condition-bearing form (v2: LOOKS LIKE / DOES NOT APPLY WHEN / MAY vs SHOULD),
# and FORMAT=v2 so the delivery header asks the reader to check the card against the board (the flown A1
# path, patch v39). One declared change vs arm 1: the form of the note. Same settings otherwise.
